        listed per piece); the decks, patio and stairs walkable at their heights","dune":"walkable
        sand; the sand fence a blocker, open at each stair; the stairs are stairs","props":"each
        a blocker on its footprint, with its stations (traps, fish table, kayaks,
        beds, the shed, the line)","lights":"windows and the door lanterns on the
        lamp rule (dusk to bedtime); the beach fire lit on a summer night (the evening
        board)","vehicles":"the pickup ambient, parked; the skiff on its trailer is
        the fisherman\u2019s"}'
